<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - First Brands said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - First Brands said cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns analyst Constance Maneaty downgraded First Brands Corp to neutral from buy, according to a Bear Stearns source.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- shares closed down 3-3/8 to 22-5/8 on Friday.</p>
<p>-- company said Friday that Wall Street estimates were too high for the current fiscal quarter and for the fiscal year that begins July 1.</p>
</text>
